  "ingredients": [
    "3.25 cups white sugar",
    "0.75 pound unsalted butter, at room temperature",
    "6 extra large eggs, at room temperature",
    "2 teaspoons pure vanilla extract",
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "1 cup 1% milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Grease and flour a 12-cup fluted tube pan (such as Bundt).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d0eMJROKvD1nB7NyUMkhzdj6KCI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280318-homemade-pound-cake-DDMFS-step-01-27983a975df246de94315b7688ea9bad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280318/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cream sugar and butter in a large mixing bowl on medium speed until light and fluffy, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TPSqY168brio6Bw1Yjr3bqtkJro=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280318-homemade-pound-cake-DDMFS-step-02-93113e00b74b4d4b844a8f7eed4d5f65.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280318/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add eggs, one at a time, beating for 45 seconds after each addition. Add vanilla extract and beat for 30 seconds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-M9-xNLD1FJv757eVVTteH_PmOs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280318-homemade-pound-cake-DDMFS-step-03-93ba176b3ec1462f8c29ebdee7f9b8e0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280318/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, baking powder, salt, and nutmeg in a medium bowl. Add 1/2 of the flour mixture to the butter mixture and mix on low speed until just blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WmYkUcZ2zQlbANAMbFQKIHhixWQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280318-homemade-pound-cake-DDMFS-step-04-a9560270ec45487481c47d4fa986fc02.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280318/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 1/2 cup milk and beat on low speed until just blended. Scrape the sides of the bowl with a spatula between each addition. Repeat with remaining flour mixture and milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rCDTz8_1MoqVMEUb9scwJ9u7gbI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280318-homemade-pound-cake-DDMFS-step-05-844a83342674453faf48856795057726.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280318/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour batter into the prepared baking pan, filling no more than 2/3 full. Smooth the top with a spoon or a spatula.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/by8yR8NBoRZXoAYKyZuJ0ewd7-E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280318-homemade-pound-cake-DDMFS-step-06-7c1ee360fc2640ab8e5faa39130961c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280318/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean and the cake is just starting to pull away from the sides of the pan, about 1 hour and 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tHFLU69g9UvmauZ48a9qPcXbN7s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280318-homemade-pound-cake-DDMFS-step-07-803ae7be05ea41ebaa6ea6cd2e8dbb7b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280318/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven and allow to cool for about 15 minutes before inverting onto a plate. Allow to cool completely before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N57CQdVGgudFi3PNfjJ52iffXNk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280318-homemade-pound-cake-DDMFS-beauty-4x3-eee5d29ed4114816abdfd65ef6e8b109.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280318/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
